(   coordinated GTP hydrolysis triggers release of SRP, transferring the ribosome-nascent chain to) Tj
T*
(   the Sec61 Translocon.) Tj
T*
(   4. Translocation and Processing:) Tj
T*
(   - Sec61 is a heterotrimeric membrane channel \(alpha, beta, gamma\) featuring a central hourglass) Tj
T*
(   pore and a lateral gate.) Tj
T*
(   - Resumed translation feeds the growing chain through the hydrophilic channel into the ER) Tj
T*
(   lumen.) Tj
T*
(   - Signal Peptidase cleaves the signal peptide.) Tj
T*
(   - Oligosaccharyltransferase \(OST\) transfers a pre-assembled Glc3Man9GlcNAc2 oligosaccharide) Tj
T*
(   onto consensus Asn-X-Ser/Thr motifs \(N-linked glycosylation\), and ER chaperones \(BiP/GRP78,) Tj
T*
(   Calnexin\) guide proper folding.) Tj
